# Terraform local state and secrets-bearing files must never be committed.
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
terraform.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars
backend.hcl
*.tfplan
tfplan
# .terraform.lock.hcl is generated by `terraform init` and IS committed once generated.
